---
manual: art.stroke_fill_oval_example
lines: [1639, 1640]
testability: visual
display: native
ledger: M1
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  stroke red
  fill blue
  oval top: 10, left: 10,
  radius: 100
end
----------- test code
# M1: the radius: style is a true radius, so the pie is 200 wide, not the "one-hundred
# pixels" the prose says (manual 1644-1645 is errata).
assert_equal [0, 0, 255], pixel_at(205, 110).first(3), "the pie reaches x = 205"
assert_equal [0, 0, 255], pixel_at(110, 205).first(3), "and y = 205"
assert_equal [255, 255, 255], pixel_at(215, 110).first(3), "and stops at 210 across"
assert_equal [255, 255, 255], pixel_at(110, 215).first(3), "and 210 down"
